  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For hydrogen atom :&nbsp;</p><p>For Lyman series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>Rr</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8734;</mo></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#160;So,&#160;</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mtext>ion&#160;</mtext></math></p><p>Balmer series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open